title: GroupPicInteract
---
Kai’s probably chasing another story again. 
Everytime he disappears for more than a week, he’s definitely hooked onto something good. 
I..
->am happy for him 
    He’s only been here for a year, but he’s doing so well. 
->wish my job was as successful 
    He’s only been here for a year and he has more stories than I do. 
He brings me coffee every morning, latte with two espresso shots. 
Everytime he’s out of town I miss it, the one i buy downstairs just doesn’t tastes like the one he brings me. 
I wonder where he bought it. 
We’ve been chatting for a while, i can feel he wants a relationship but…
->I’m waiting for the right moment
->We don’t know each other well enough
->I’m too busy with work, I don’t have time for a relationship. 
===
